    "detailed_description": "Throwing Punches is a boxing game where you can punch your opponents from a distance. Throw your punches and control them in flight while dodging enemy attacks. It can be a real workout! You can slow down time if the situation gets out of control.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGo through 12 levels consisting of 4 stages each as fast as you can to stand at the top of the leaderboards!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest yourself in Endless Random mode - whether you clear the stage or not - you never know what comes next!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperiment with modifiers - make your fists go faster, disable gravity, or change the slow motion controls!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow with three ways to control slow motion: manual, &quot;if you move, time moves&quot; and &quot;time slows down when bullets are nearby&quot;",
